__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules

# Working copies of the recorded plates, dropped next to the short-form stage
# so the page can load them same-origin. Regenerate with
# tools/record-bulk-plate.mjs and tools/record-promo.mjs; they are tens of MB
# and the scripts that make them are the thing worth keeping.
tools/tiktok/*.webm

# A /brag run (github.com/latent-spaces/brag): a scaffolded Hyperframes project
# plus its render. The composition is small but its assets are not -- copies of
# the four store screenshots, the fonts, a vendored GSAP, snapshot frames and a
# 4.5MB MP4, all regenerable with `hyperframes render` inside it. A finished
# video that the site actually uses belongs in assets/ alongside the other
# three, deliberately placed rather than swept in by a directory add.
brag-output/

# wrangler dev's local state
.wrangler/
